  "details": "I am working on a tool that helps moderation be easier, by assisting in logging our actions in the group.\n\nFrom testing, I've discovered that banning user who are not a part of the group (These were alts, no actual users have been used as test subjects to this.) counts as a member less in the group, and thus have resulted in a negative member count now.\n\nI've been banning through the API to test the logging and slowly realized my member count going down.",
